{
  "total_duration": 755.323,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.536,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果一个地方有一棵"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "cursed tree"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，听起来像 bad luck。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 5.886,
      "end": 9.446,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是有时候，坏名声反而会吸引人来围观。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 9.796,
      "end": 14.296,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这就像中文说的：塞翁失马，焉知非福。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 14.645,
      "end": 19.045,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Frinley 的这棵树被报纸提到以后，游客反而越来越多。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 19.395,
      "end": 27.427,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天先抓住一个问题："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "bad reputation"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "怎么会变成"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a useful source of income"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 27.777,
      "end": 30.697,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一段，先看小村和怪树。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 31.047,
      "end": 39.727,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Frinley 这个 tiny village 据说有一棵 cursed tree；这棵树在 church 附近，近几年有了坏名声。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 40.077,
      "end": 45.597,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文开头说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The tiny village of Frinley is said to possess a 'cursed tree'"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 45.946,
      "end": 54.026,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Is said to possess"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "的意思是“据说拥有”，注意它只是人们这么说，不等于已经证明。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 54.376,
      "end": 60.336,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这棵树不是新冒出来的："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The tree was planted near the church fifty years ago"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 60.686,
      "end": 68.174,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Church"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是教堂；在英国小村里，教堂常常也是大家熟悉的公共地标。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 68.524,
      "end": 75.884,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可真正的坏名声是后来才出现的："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "only in recent years has it gained an evil reputation"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 76.234,
      "end": 83.914,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住中文反差：树在 church 附近已经很久，但 cursed reputation 是近几年才变响的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 84.264,
      "end": 87.344,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二段，看坏名声怎样被传播。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 87.693,
      "end": 95.453,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：报纸提到了这棵树，来 Frinley 的游客数量就增加了；关于这棵树的说法也越来越夸张。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 95.803,
      "end": 102.983,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Because the tree was mentioned in a newspaper, the number of visitors to Frinley has now increased"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 103.333,
      "end": 112.117,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "newspaper"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "像今天的短视频或热门帖子，会把一个小地方突然推到很多人面前。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 112.467,
      "end": 118.491,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "传说的表达是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It is said that if anyone touches the tree, he will have bad luck"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 118.841,
      "end": 123.564,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "后面更夸张："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "if he picks a leaf, he will die"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 123.914,
      "end": 131.33,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "还要听出 reported rumor 的味道："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Many villagers believe that the tree has already claimed a number of victims"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 131.68,
      "end": 140.164,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It is said"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "villagers believe"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "都在告诉我们：这是传闻和相信，不是画面里的证据。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 140.514,
      "end": 146.314,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧记住：newspaper 让游客增加，rumor 让树更出名。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 146.664,
      "end": 150.664,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三段，村民想砍树，vicar 却拒绝。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 151.014,
      "end": 160.054,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：大家请求 vicar 让人把树砍掉；但到目前为止，他拒绝了，因为这棵树带来了游客和收入。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 160.403,
      "end": 166.935,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The vicar has been asked to have the tree cut down, but so far he has refused"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 167.285,
      "end": 175.061,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Vicar"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是英国教区里的牧师，可以理解成小村教堂里的 local church leader。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 175.411,
      "end": 182.415,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Have the tree cut down"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是 vicar 自己拿斧头砍树，而是安排别人把树砍掉。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 182.765,
      "end": 188.785,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但他的理由很实际："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He has pointed out that the tree is a useful source of income"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 189.135,
      "end": 195.598,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "为什么是 income？因为："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "tourists have been coming from all parts of the country to see it"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 195.948,
      "end": 203.772,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里就接到标题了：一棵听起来倒霉的树，反而可能是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a blessing in disguise"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 204.122,
      "end": 211.682,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧记住：villagers want it cut down，vicar refuses，because tourists bring income。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 212.032,
      "end": 214.472,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四段，看最后的讽刺。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 214.822,
      "end": 225.502,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：尽管有这些传说，游客还是摘叶子、在树干上刻名字；到目前为止，没有一个人突然死去。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 225.852,
      "end": 233.488,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of all that has been said, the tourists have been picking leaves and cutting their names on the tree-trunk"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 233.838,
      "end": 240.558,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是“尽管”，说明他们听过警告，却仍然这么做。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 240.907,
      "end": 250.747,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "但这里要有一个现实边界：故事里写游客这样做，是为了讽刺；现实里不能破坏树，也不能在公共地方乱刻。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 251.097,
      "end": 258.137,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "结尾一句很有反差："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "So far, not one of them has been struck down by sudden death"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 258.487,
      "end": 264.143,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "So far"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是到目前为止；它把传说和证据分开了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 264.493,
      "end": 272.493,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧记住：tourists ignore the warning，their behavior is wrong，but the curse has not visibly worked。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 272.843,
      "end": 279.719,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，题目"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A blessing in disguise?"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是不是说这棵树其实很好？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 280.069,
      "end": 288.909,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是这么简单。它的意思更像“塞翁失马，焉知非福”：一件事看起来像 bad luck，后来却可能带来 good luck。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 289.259,
      "end": 292.621,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那这棵树为什么可能是 blessing？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 292.97,
      "end": 303.222,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "bad reputation"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "变成了 attention，attention 变成了 tourism，tourism 又变成了"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "income"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 303.572,
      "end": 306.867,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是 cursed tree 听起来还是有点吓人。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 307.217,
      "end": 317.217,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以题目后面有问号。它带来收入，但也带来迷信和不太文明的游客行为，这个 blessing 是 funny and uneasy。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 317.567,
      "end": 320.742,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这些传说是真的被证明了吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 321.091,
      "end": 330.855,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文一直用"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It is said"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "villagers believe"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。这表示“有人这样说”，不是“我确定是真的”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 331.205,
      "end": 332.692,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "证据在哪里？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 333.042,
      "end": 339.162,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "结尾的证据是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "So far, not one of them has been struck down by sudden death"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 339.512,
      "end": 341.785,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以这课不是恐怖故事？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 342.135,
      "end": 351.695,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。这课是 village satire。它笑的是：一个坏名声被传播以后，竟然能变成 tourist attraction。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 352.045,
      "end": 356.029,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The tiny village of Frinley is said to possess a 'cursed tree'."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 356.379,
      "end": 362.163,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Because the tree was mentioned in a newspaper, the number of visitors to Frinley has now increased."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 362.513,
      "end": 369.617,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The tree was planted near the church fifty years ago, but it is only in recent years that it has gained an evil reputation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 369.967,
      "end": 376.255,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It is said that if anyone touches the tree, he will have bad luck; if he picks a leaf, he will die."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "start": 376.605,
      "end": 381.429,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Many villagers believe that the tree has already claimed a number of victims."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "start": 381.779,
      "end": 386.867,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The vicar has been asked to have the tree cut down, but so far he has refused."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "start": 387.216,
      "end": 394.464,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "He has pointed out that the tree is a useful source of income, as tourists have been coming from all parts of the country to see it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 58,
      "start": 394.814,
      "end": 400.982,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of all that has been said, the tourists have been picking leaves and cutting their names on the tree-trunk."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 59,
      "start": 401.332,
      "end": 405.724,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "So far, not one of them has been struck down by sudden death!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
