    },
    {
      "i": 62,
      "start": 410.95,
      "end": 415.726,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "cursed"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Cursed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "在这篇课文里是“据说会带来坏运气的”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 63,
      "start": 416.076,
      "end": 423.215,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "cursed"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a 'cursed tree'"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，引号也在提醒我们：这是一个被人这样称呼的传说。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 64,
      "start": 423.565,
      "end": 428.725,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "cursed"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不要把它读成恐怖片；它更像一个 mysterious reputation。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 65,
      "start": 429.075,
      "end": 432.139,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reputation"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二个词："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "reputation"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 66,
      "start": 432.489,
      "end": 434.457,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reputation"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Reputation"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 67,
      "start": 434.807,
      "end": 441.151,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reputation"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Reputation"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是名声，也就是别人怎样谈论你或一个地方。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 68,
      "start": 441.501,
      "end": 445.2,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reputation"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "it has gained an evil reputation"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 69,
      "start": 445.55,
      "end": 453.75,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reputation"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Gained"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "说明这个名声是慢慢形成的；树很早就种下了，但坏名声是近几年才有的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 70,
      "start": 454.1,
      "end": 459.78,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "reputation"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这一课的讽刺就在这里："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "bad reputation"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "can bring attention。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 71,
      "start": 460.13,
      "end": 463.002,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "income"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三个词："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "income"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 72,
      "start": 463.352,
      "end": 465.008,
