    },
    {
      "i": 74,
      "start": 469.459,
      "end": 473.471,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "income"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the tree is a useful source of income"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 75,
      "start": 473.821,
      "end": 480.117,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "income"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Source"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是来源；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "source of income"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是收入来源。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 76,
      "start": 480.467,
      "end": 487.427,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "vocab",
      "scene_meta": {
        "word": "income"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为游客从全国各地来看树，小村可能会有更多生意，所以 vicar 才拒绝砍树。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 77,
      "start": 487.777,
      "end": 492.657,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天的语法板块叫：怎样写“传闻、结果和反差”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 78,
      "start": 493.006,
      "end": 497.142,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一块是 reported rumor："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "is said to"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 79,
      "start": 497.492,
      "end": 502.932,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "例句是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The tiny village of Frinley is said to possess a 'cursed tree'"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 80,
      "start": 503.282,
      "end": 505.562,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它表示“据说”，不是“已经证明”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 81,
      "start": 505.912,
      "end": 509.096,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二块是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It is said that"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 82,
      "start": 509.446,
      "end": 515.27,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "例句是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It is said that if anyone touches the tree, he will have bad luck"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 83,
      "start": 515.62,
      "end": 518.62,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个结构很适合引出 rumor 或 hearsay。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 84,
      "start": 518.969,
      "end": 524.009,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三块是 present perfect：过去发生的事影响到现在。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 85,
      "start": 524.359,
      "end": 533.951,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "你会看到："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "has now increased"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "has gained"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "has refused"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "has pointed out"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 86,
      "start": 534.301,
      "end": 541.661,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这些都在说现在的结果：游客变多了，坏名声形成了，vicar 到现在还没同意。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 87,
      "start": 542.011,
      "end": 547.563,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四块是 present perfect continuous："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "tourists have been coming"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 88,
      "start": 547.912,
      "end": 554.072,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个形式强调动作一直反复发生到现在，所以游客不是只来了一次。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 89,
      "start": 554.422,
      "end": 557.822,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第五块是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "have something done"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 90,
      "start": 558.172,
      "end": 563.796,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Have the tree cut down"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "的意思是安排别人把树砍掉。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 91,
      "start": 564.146,
      "end": 569.41,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第六块是对比连接："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of all that has been said"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 92,
      "start": 569.76,
      "end": 575.8,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In spite of"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "表示“尽管”，后面接游客不听传说、继续行动。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 93,
      "start": 576.15,
      "end": 587.085,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "grammar",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后记住"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "So far"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "加 present perfect："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "So far, not one of them has been struck down"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，到目前为止还没有发生。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 94,
      "start": 587.435,
      "end": 595.051,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "现在把今天的 rumor and income 放进一个安全的现代场景："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The Strange Little Cafe"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 95,
      "start": 595.401,
      "end": 601.521,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "有一家小咖啡店，门口有一把很旧的 chair，被网上说成会带来 bad luck。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 96,
      "start": 601.871,
      "end": 608.271,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个名声听起来不好，但越来越多人来拍照打卡，咖啡店生意反而变好了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 97,
      "start": 608.621,
      "end": 613.933,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "店主说，这把 chair 成了"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a useful source of income"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 98,
      "start": 614.282,
      "end": 622.89,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "you_too",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个练习不是让你相信迷信，而是练一条结构："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "bad reputation became attention, and attention became income"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
